WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:02.980
(bright music)

00:00:05.224 --> 00:00:06.235
- My name's Douglas Kim,

00:00:06.235 --> 00:00:07.875
owner and chef at Jeju Noodle Bar.

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:10.645
I've been working in the
restaurant industry for 19 years.

00:00:10.645 --> 00:00:14.812
Today, I have a privilege
to taste instant ramens.

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:22.071
Wow, smells very familiar,
but is not in a good way.

00:00:22.071 --> 00:00:23.988
The color looks very...

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.668
I don't remember when the
last time I actually had this.

00:00:28.668 --> 00:00:29.991
Very, very watery.

00:00:29.991 --> 00:00:33.009
Flavor wise, very, very commercial.

00:00:33.009 --> 00:00:35.028
Very instant flavor.

00:00:35.028 --> 00:00:36.148
To be honest with you, I
don't even know if this is

00:00:36.148 --> 00:00:37.620
tastes like a chicken or not.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.453
One star.

00:00:38.453 --> 00:00:41.249
I respect the people
who created this ramen,

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:43.916
that's why I gave them one star.

00:00:46.119 --> 00:00:48.649
Uh huh, already looks a
little more complicated.

00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:50.300
I see the black garlic oil.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.517
Smells a little more refined.

00:00:52.517 --> 00:00:53.350
Not bad.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.753
Noodle is a little more
skinnier, slightly softer,

00:00:56.753 --> 00:00:57.852
but in a good way.

00:00:57.852 --> 00:00:59.433
Still full of MSG flavor.

00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:00.673
Very umami.

00:01:00.673 --> 00:01:02.044
Actually, I was pretty surprised.

00:01:02.044 --> 00:01:03.422
The taste's not bad.

00:01:03.422 --> 00:01:04.732
I clearly enjoyed this one.

00:01:04.732 --> 00:01:05.565
2.5 star.

00:01:08.962 --> 00:01:11.676
This one is very familiar.

00:01:11.676 --> 00:01:14.225
Actually, it smells not that good though.

00:01:14.225 --> 00:01:15.225
Damn, spicy.

00:01:15.225 --> 00:01:16.076
Oh my god.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.036
It's really spicy.

00:01:17.036 --> 00:01:19.985
It's too spicy that I
don't taste anything else.

00:01:19.985 --> 00:01:21.654
Noodle wise, this is the so far best.

00:01:21.654 --> 00:01:23.084
It has more chew to it.

00:01:23.084 --> 00:01:25.124
Taste is a little too spicy for me.

00:01:25.124 --> 00:01:27.324
I have a limit to take

00:01:27.324 --> 00:01:28.884
in a certain spice level.

00:01:28.884 --> 00:01:31.217
This one, I give it 2.5 too.

00:01:34.121 --> 00:01:34.954
Wow.

00:01:34.954 --> 00:01:36.894
It has a more body in the broth.

00:01:36.894 --> 00:01:39.625
Noodle itself is a lot thicker.

00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:40.956
Noodles very nice.

00:01:40.956 --> 00:01:43.204
I taste a little less MSG.

00:01:43.204 --> 00:01:45.225
Broth is more richer.

00:01:45.225 --> 00:01:46.854
It's sticking into the noodles.

00:01:46.854 --> 00:01:48.545
Looks like a proper ramen.

00:01:48.545 --> 00:01:50.505
It's pretty good quality around it.

00:01:50.505 --> 00:01:52.324
It's pretty close to,

00:01:52.324 --> 00:01:54.214
yeah, just regular ramen.

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.025
If you give it to someone else,

00:01:56.025 --> 00:01:58.214
you can probably fake it.

00:01:58.214 --> 00:01:59.131
Three star.

00:02:02.505 --> 00:02:04.324
Smells nice, smells very instant.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:05.824
Good smell of MSG.

00:02:07.014 --> 00:02:07.847
Not bad.

00:02:07.847 --> 00:02:08.694
Pretty sweet.

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:09.527
Actually, I like this.

00:02:09.527 --> 00:02:10.774
When I went to military school

00:02:10.774 --> 00:02:11.865
almost 20 years ago,

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.884
I remember Indonesian students
would always buy that.

00:02:13.884 --> 00:02:15.174
We swapped noodles.

00:02:15.174 --> 00:02:16.156
Very flavorful.

00:02:16.156 --> 00:02:17.964
It's not really pleasant
looking, but taste is good.

00:02:17.964 --> 00:02:19.345
Noodle texture is good too.

00:02:19.345 --> 00:02:20.356
Flavor is very nice.

00:02:20.356 --> 00:02:21.189
Three, I would say.

00:02:21.189 --> 00:02:22.164
I really liked it.

00:02:22.164 --> 00:02:23.974
Instant noodle in general
is very convenient

00:02:23.974 --> 00:02:25.116
for many people.

00:02:25.116 --> 00:02:26.316
Myself too, you know.

00:02:26.316 --> 00:02:29.134
But when you at least go
to a real ramen restaurant,

00:02:29.134 --> 00:02:30.924
everything come from scratch,

00:02:30.924 --> 00:02:33.956
and definitely when you
actually eat a fresh ramen,

00:02:33.956 --> 00:02:36.484
it's kind of hard to go
back to instant ramen.

00:02:36.484 --> 00:02:40.244
That's why we recommend you
to go to real ramen restaurant

00:02:40.244 --> 00:02:41.884
and try real ramen.

00:02:41.884 --> 00:02:44.425
Smell is not that spicy,

00:02:44.425 --> 00:02:47.094
but, actually, I take it back.

00:02:47.094 --> 00:02:49.414
I gotta itchy hair right now.

00:02:49.414 --> 00:02:50.247
Oh my god.

